sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Voter as Registered Voter
    participant Client as VoterLens Mobile Client
    participant Cache as Local Encrypted SQLite / IndexedDB
    participant API as Civic Intelligence Gateway (QVF + FEC + Trail)

    Voter->>Client: Launches VoterLens App
    Client->>Cache: Check for cached precinct & ballot
    alt Cache Hit (Offline Ready)
        Cache-->>Client: Return cached 2026 Michigan Senate Slate
        Client-->>Voter: Display Civic Reel & Verified Ballot
    else Cache Miss / First Launch
        Client->>Voter: Prompt for Michigan Precinct / ZIP
        Voter->>Client: Enters ZIP (e.g. 48386 - White Lake)
        Client->>API: Query QVF certified candidates & precinct rules
        API-->>Client: Certified Nominees: El-Sayed (D), Rogers (R), Marsh (G), Christensen (L), Long (USTP)
        Client->>Cache: Persist slate & logistics data locally
        Client-->>Voter: Render Live Civic Feed
    end

    Voter->>Client: Taps Debate Audio Soundbite ('EV Mandates')
    Client->>Cache: Retrieve cached audio stream & verbatim text
    Client-->>Voter: Renders waveform visualizer & synchronized captions

    Voter->>Client: Selects Candidate & Taps 'Export Booth Pass'
    Client->>Cache: Encrypt ballot selections with voter private salt
    Client-->>Voter: Renders high-contrast offline pass with precinct hours & accepted ID checklist
